sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant F as Frontend (Next.js)
    participant A as API (Express)
    participant E as Encryption Service
    participant S as S3
    participant M as MongoDB
    participant L as Security Log

    U->>F: Select file + Upload
    F->>A: POST /api/files/upload
    A->>A: Validate + Auth
    A->>E: Encrypt(buffer, vaultKey)
    E-->>A: Encrypted data + IV + metadata
    A->>S: PutObject(encrypted data)
    S-->>A: 200 OK
    A->>M: Save File metadata
    M-->>A: Saved document
    A->>L: Log FILE_UPLOAD
    L-->>A: Logged
    A-->>F: 201 Created (file metadata)
    F-->>U: Upload success
